{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consciousness...  Where? Unknown. Who are all these dudes in robes? Only one way forward: through the door.</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/extras/86d898237eef3e4084e96e33722a79d4.avif?t=1766594133\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the afterlife\u2019s strangest waiting room, where each run reshapes the world, the dangers, and your very questionable chances of survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step pushes you closer to the truth of why you are here, and what this place wants from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Dead is a roguelite twin-stick shooter with a relaxed pace, retro feel, and a fondness for the odd and curious. Combat is fast when it needs to be, but with as much emphasis on atmosphere and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet creatures that range from charming to deeply irritating. Find weapons infused with questionable magic. Gather strange effects that can help, hurt, or quietly complicate everything. Die and die again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/extras/892fe5e369d9cca2501269c45886aba4.avif?t=1766594133\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A strange, cozy afterlife full of weird characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Weapons that evolve from useful to slightly unhinged</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Persistent unlocks that reshape future attempts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Retro visuals, chill music, and intentional pacing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Controller or mouse and keyboard support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Encounters designed to be learned, not rushed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Creative problem solving (cheese encouraged)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Are Dead</strong> keeps growing with new features and content. Step through the door again and see what the afterlife serves you next.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2962990?t=1766594133","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/a99d5f41cef7f141c6d6323b4124b8a148b6e728/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766594133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/09b0f8bd29ea8d095f147c8b41a97e8f3c8a7d91/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766594133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/09b0f8bd29ea8d095f147c8b41a97e8f3c8a7d91/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766594133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consciousness...  Where? Unknown. Who are all these dudes in robes? Only one way forward: through the door.</strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/extras/86d898237eef3e4084e96e33722a79d4.avif?t=1766594133\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the afterlife\u2019s strangest waiting room, where each run reshapes the world, the dangers, and your very questionable chances of survival. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step pushes you closer to the truth of why you are here, and what this place wants from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You Are Dead is a roguelite twin-stick shooter with a relaxed pace, retro feel, and a fondness for the odd and curious. Combat is fast when it needs to be, but with as much emphasis on atmosphere and personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet creatures that range from charming to deeply irritating. Find weapons infused with questionable magic. Gather strange effects that can help, hurt, or quietly complicate everything. Die and die again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/extras/892fe5e369d9cca2501269c45886aba4.avif?t=1766594133\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 A strange, cozy afterlife full of weird characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Weapons that evolve from useful to slightly unhinged</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Persistent unlocks that reshape future attempts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Retro visuals, chill music, and intentional pacing</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Controller or mouse and keyboard support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Encounters designed to be learned, not rushed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Creative problem solving (cheese encouraged)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Are Dead</strong> keeps growing with new features and content. Step through the door again and see what the afterlife serves you next.</p>","developers":["Oh No Pono Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2962990/fb2cd09555a21ec203681f8f4c0dfed3320b5f4a/header.jpg?t=1766594133","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 13 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Apple Silicon<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 13 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or Apple Silicon (M1 or later)<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2962990/2128720755/1d3f8e697249cf9f0ed0c0f2b7681a04011d12df/1766259481/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766261041","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2962990/2128720755/1d3f8e697249cf9f0ed0c0f2b7681a04011d12df/1766259481/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766261041","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2962990/2128720755/1d3f8e697249cf9f0ed0c0f2b7681a04011d12df/1766259481/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766261041","id":257126925,"name":"You Are Dead - Combat Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126925/c387d6925d4bc4e9b550f407074a04e6499647a7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766261041"}],"name":"You Are Dead","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics (Intel UH